# fling-video (M9): the fling at real speed, for the eye (plan call 15: WebKit's recorder). The same
# flick as fling (100 px right in about 96 ms on the empty plane, let go still moving, the pointer
# then off the plane), recorded on the real clock for 1.4 s, so the glide's ease-out to a stop shows
# as a person sees it; natively a video records nothing, and fling's frames give the values.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 700 600
wait 100
video start fling
wait 200
down
move 800 600 over 96
up
move 482 500
wait 1100
video stop
